<title>USA: Dime Community Bancorp Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dime Community Bancorp Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.26			N/A</p>
<p> Net			  3,498		   $1,483</p>
<p>			  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.72			N/A</p>
<p> Net			  9,661		    5,577</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 includes gain of $1.0 million, or $0.07 a share, from recovery of a New York City deferred tax liability.  </p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes a gain of $0.14 a share from deferred tax liability recovery.</p>
<p>1996 operations reflect operations prior to initial public offering and acquisition of Conestoga Bancorp Inc on June 26, 1996.</p>
<p>Assets as of March 31, 1997: $1.24 billion.</p>
<p>Net loans as of March 31, 1997: $672.8 million.</p>
<p>Deposits as of March 31, 1997: $962.3 million.</p>
